{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_toddi_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_toddi_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "裝甲與重弩",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_toddi_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "42f387c786f093923b9ae7a4ff589b6ce26a88ac1e85251e25a43dcb84df0f9c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哈......哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......呼......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "左邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，斐迪亞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我和暴躁鐵皮已經在向左移動了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的意思是，破城矢的落點在左邊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你擋我炮位了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斐迪亞，還活著嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "說真的，我從沒打過這麼難受的架。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這個大傢伙還蠻結實的嘛。嗯，應該只是被爆炸波及了，看起來沒什麼大損傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許破城矢的裝藥量可以再提高兩成？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "那我絕對不會再和你出任務了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嗯......三號關節的液壓系統不太穩定，這筆維修費你幫我出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不能怪我，你的機甲真的很影響視野，也真的很適合被攻城弩來一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有機會真得試試，應該打得穿吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......賭上提亞卡烏的名譽，下次你部門內的武器預算申請，我一定投反對票。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "開什麼玩笑，你懂不懂攻城武器的重要性？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "師父說了，羅德島不會裝備任何攻城武器。這不符合我們的中立原則。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "不過，你這個大弓箭，也算不得攻城武器就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什......？！便攜攻城弩也是攻城弩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "這弓箭連引擎都沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "弓箭本來就沒有引擎！還有我這個是弩炮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我部落裡的弓箭就是有引擎的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......想打架嗎，斐迪亞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我叫祖瑪瑪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，當我們不存在嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉＆森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "閉嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就看看你這堆廢銅爛鐵，到底能不能扛住一發破城矢吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "樂意奉陪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個......打擾一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嫌命長嗎？我們這裡忙著呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "二位就是羅德島吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "您是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，順便提醒你們一下，那架弩炮的右側扭力系統應該是在剛剛的戰鬥中磨損了，繼續使用的話會對精確度有點影響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那邊的......呃......黃色曳引機？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你可以叫她暴躁鐵皮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最好看看冷卻系統的狀況，再拖下去引擎會有異響的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......真的！謝謝你，呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你可以叫我老喬，初次見面，羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是這次任務的委託人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們的行動編組......只有兩個人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不信任我們的專業能力嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼會，你們可是懾砂推薦的。羅德島的名字......在荒地人中也不算陌生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是，再怎麼說，兩個人也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "哈哈......的確是出了一些意外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再行駛一個小時左右就抵達情報所描述的廢棄地塊的位置了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "熔泉，森蚺，裝備檢查得怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "呼，剛剛裝完車。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "暴躁鐵皮狀態良好，之前和師父做了一次全面升級，現在駕駛位坐起來舒服多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，這次行動的確沒看到那隻奇怪的黎博利......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "大祭司爺爺說不能總靠他來駕駛，這畢竟是我的機甲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你來開我反倒更放心一點......熔泉，攻城弩狀態正常嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我說，聽博士說有個廢棄地塊可以打，我才來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "結果，居然是個營救任務？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......現在才反應過來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈——我可是為了這次任務，熬了三個大夜，特別趕製了一批超重型破城矢！結果居然是營救在廢棄地塊裡的荒地人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "熔泉......下次行動前好好看看任務簡報？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為有敵人已經佔領地塊並憑藉工事反擊的可能，我才向博士申請指派你們幾個有攻堅能力的幹員來的，以防萬一嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "就算面對的是廢棄地塊，可那畢竟曾經是移動城市的一部分，準備好重武器總是沒錯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，早知道去逛街了，沒勁——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽說這批荒地人跟著移動城市遷徙了很久了，好不容易等到有地塊報廢，本來想趁機過幾天舒服日子，也能從廢棄地塊裡找些補給。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "結果，這裡的帕夏和“約翰老媽”早就簽了一份回收合約。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，他們做生意的方式一向是比較直接的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們在前面的坎寧路口集合，從西南方向......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打斷一下，煌大姐，你有沒有覺得能見度有點低？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "風聲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
