      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你們運氣不錯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "還好是一場小型的雷沙暴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出來就遇到了那幫自稱沙蜥幫的人，揍起來麻煩得要死。如果我一個人處理可能反而還輕鬆一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "喂！明明是你亂放箭的錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有提示落點，你自己躲得太慢了。"
