    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "二位，我們到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到的有些晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽好了，你們非法竊據了約翰老媽旗下資源回收公司的固有財產，根據約翰老媽的使用者條款，我們有權利對你們進行合理的驅逐與反擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_329_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大人，我們沒做任何傷天害理的事情啊！呃啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_006",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "救......救命！我的孩子還在裡面！"
