    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是總部說的那幫厲害傢伙！回擊，回擊，別讓那輛曳引機接近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "再說一遍！她叫暴躁鐵皮——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用節約彈藥，把你們的炮彈都打出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，小姑娘！小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祖瑪瑪，刹車！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "就這點火力？別小看了我們工程部機甲小組心血的結晶呀——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "怎麼不動了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "退後，祖瑪瑪，我來火力掩護！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我在重新發動引擎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小姑娘，你引擎的第三進氣閥燒了，我這有備用零件，掩護我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最後警告，你們正在妨礙約翰老媽執行合約！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫成員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，老大，我們的炮沒了，那紅髮娘們打得真準！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快嘴，把那門炮給我幹掉。我們去解決掉那小蛇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "第四發爆破矢準備！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "休想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈！紅髮娘們，你那大弓箭太危險了，老子接管了！現在站在那裡別動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......真麻煩啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你聽好了，不管你們是誰，那幫荒地雜種是怎麼聯繫到你們的。我們清掃掉那幫垃圾是合法合規的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出示一下合約看看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嘿，你看，我們並不是荒野暴徒，我們是資源回收從業者，是資源，就有價值，就值得被利用，比如這裡的零件和廢鐵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於不能被歸為資源的那部分，很遺憾，我們就進行適當的處理。我對這幫荒地雜種並沒有個人好惡，但這就是規矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“回收利用是文明的本質”，這是我們公司的口號，貼在辦公室牆上的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是你坦率地告訴我，你信奉誰拳頭大誰厲害，我還能高看你一眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰讓你說話了！現在是我在教育你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給我聽好了，你管一場屠戮叫“文明”？你管切斷喉管叫“回收”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這娘們！明明是個炮手，為什麼——呃啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那老頭抱著包逃命，你們追逐他取樂，那女人想救她的孩子，你們扯著她的頭髮拖開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們不過是一幫碰巧拿上了刀槍的懦夫，想找些老弱病殘逞逞威風罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別小看我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，終於拿出了點骨氣，想比比誰的拳頭大了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我告訴你，我拳頭比你大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "熔泉，沒事吧！我來幫你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小心操作！我只是暫時讓你的鐵疙瘩能動了而已！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就這些雜魚？嘖，心情不爽，活動活動好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該死，碰上難對付的傢伙了！撤，撤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "哇，我好不容易才找到路欸，這就結束了？再陪我玩玩嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥幫隊長",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噫——快走，跑啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "都結束了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，跑了一部分。不過，他們說的帕夏和約翰老媽的協議......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#10",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "約翰老媽不會承認的。不過這幫荒地人也得儘快轉移，有幾個感染者的病情不太樂觀啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "熔泉，剛才還挺險的，還好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你幹嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，這攻城弩的弦軸穩定器被切掉了，大概是曳引機入場的時候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這一拳，你給我老實受著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你之前也打壞了我的液壓系統啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一碼歸一碼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用管嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#10",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......熔泉小姐，我手上的材料就只能修到這個程度了，調校可能還需要你自己來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "森蚺小姐，引擎的狀況還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "謝謝你的零件，整修得差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "煌小姐還有些收尾工作需要完成，她說她會直接在本艦與二位會合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在這種氣氛，我真的很尷尬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你們那些荒地人，真的不去附近的羅德島醫療點嗎？他們有的人病得很重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是我們的生活方式，塵歸塵，土歸土，既然來到了荒野，那歸於荒野就是註定的結局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "死在礦石病手裡，和死在土匪手裡沒什麼區別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你們就沒有嚮往過......移動城市上的文明嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哈，文明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們這些荒地人，本身就是被它拋下的人，回不去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "看你的工匠手藝，你究竟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別問，別打探荒地人以前的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個聚落幫過我一次，我按規矩回報他們一次，僅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "翻過前面兩個沙丘，就到本艦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也該告辭了，謝謝你們搭我一程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿，紅髮姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老喬",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "身手不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是啊，回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "登上羅德島不會有感覺，但從這個角度看過去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......真是奇跡啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我在薩爾貢的叢林中長大，從未接觸過什麼機械之類的東西。大家用拳頭也能生活得很好。有一天，我偶然看見一座移動城市駛過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "在那個清晨，那個灰濛濛的影子，遙遠的轟鳴，我一輩子也不會忘，那是文明和進步的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "而我們，現在竟然就在其中一座上生活著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅德島不是移動城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "移動城市裡也沒有會說話的機器啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，祖瑪瑪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說，我如果在這個距離開一炮，重型破城矢能刺穿羅德島的外層裝甲嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "熔泉，如果你以後還想從師父那裡拿經費的話，我建議你不要嘗試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我出生在維多利亞，一個薩爾貢的瓦伊凡移民家庭，說起來我們算同鄉。我媽媽偶爾還會做幾道薩爾貢菜，似是而非吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "短蕉果烤鱗肉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒那麼正宗，只是些紅椒茶之類的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瓦伊凡在維多利亞立足並不容易，要不然去參軍，要不然就想辦法融入當地，我家辦了個工廠，生產一些......滑輪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒什麼技術含量，弄些廢鐵，回爐重鑄，保持好溫度，最後澆成圓的，誰都能幹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直到，我祖父買來了一台機床。不知道他從哪倒騰來的舊型號二手貨，巨大，笨重，用了不知道多少年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你能想像它第一次啟動的樣子嗎？當然慘不忍睹，可是，那巨大的雜訊和震顫，那些陳舊的機械結構打開......我聽不到自己的心跳了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "比打架爽快，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一點沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你剛才說文明與進步......我們從不管機床叫“文明”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它只是能讓我們活得更好一點罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "所以，這就是你們這次的外勤任務？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "不錯嘛！聽起來還挺刺激的！那個紅頭髮的瓦伊凡，是叫熔泉來著？聽起來是個拳頭硬的好漢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "感覺你交到了個新朋友啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
